<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">16072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Eighty detainees at America's largest immigration jail describe one documented pattern... routine beatings and denied medical care.</s> <s>Human Rights Watch and the <sub alias="American Civil Liberties Union">ACLU</sub> gathered the testimony as Homeland Security ramps up arrest quotas, turning scattered accounts into a record the state can no longer wave away.</s> <s>The department calls the findings categorically false, even as its own data show a system expanding faster than anyone can watch it.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran's parliament speaker declared the June seventeenth truce void after strikes hit three southern provinces, claiming complete freedom of action.</s> <s>The Health Ministry counts thirty-five civilians dead and three hundred wounded, while the United States threatens to strike Iranian power plants and bridges.</s> <s>Tehran now speaks of an existential war, and whether the Strait of Hormuz stays open may hinge on what it decides next.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France's National Assembly passed an assisted dying law by two hundred ninety-one votes to two hundred forty-one, one of the largest nations ever to do so.</s> <s>Only terminally ill adults with unbearable, untreatable suffering qualify... psychiatric illness and Alzheimer's are explicitly excluded.</s> <s>The Constitutional Council has a month to rule before the law can take effect, and Europe is watching whether dignity or moral rupture wins the framing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt confirmed it fields the Russian S-three hundred air-defence system, part of a secret arms deal from twenty fourteen reported above one billion dollars.</s> <s>Cairo remains one of the largest recipients of American military aid, so displaying Russian strategic hardware is itself the message... a pivotal state hedging between Washington and Moscow.</s> <s>Israeli officials say they still don't understand why Egypt needed a system that can strike aircraft two hundred kilometres away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In South Africa, a thirty-one point six five million rand fraud case against alleged gang boss Ralph Stanfield simply vanished.</s> <s>The Revenue Service found his tax refunds fraudulent, then shelved the file for two years until his accountant died, showing how organised crime survives on bureaucratic decay.</s> <s>Stanfield and twelve co-accused now face murder charges in a trial set for October, the tax route to justice already lost.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary's foreign minister brokered two hundred twenty-four rounds of talks to bring the Chinese carmaker <sub alias="B Y D">BYD</sub> undisclosed subsidies.</s> <s>Those incentives let Beijing's electric-vehicle giant sidestep the European Union's import tariffs by building inside the bloc itself.</s> <s>Budapest hasn't said whether it will investigate the subsidies, and the same minister has since joined the company he helped.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Bank of Korea raised interest rates to two point seven five percent, its first hike in three and a half years.</s> <s>Governor Shin Hyun-song cited inflation at three point two percent as Middle East conflict pushed fuel prices up nearly twenty-five percent, forcing a major export economy back into tightening by a war thousands of kilometres away.</s> <s>He signalled another rise by October, with more expected through twenty twenty-seven.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's food inflation jumped to three point seven five percent in a single month, even as the headline rate showed relief.</s> <s>Base effects from last year's currency collapse flatter the national figure while the real prices of garri and yam keep climbing on the ground.</s> <s>In Niger State, inflation runs at forty-two percent, a reminder that a falling average can still hide a deepening hunger.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>As manufacturing's share of China's output shrinks, Beijing is turning toward higher-margin producer services... design, branding, and intellectual property.</s> <s>The country that owns global assembly is trying to capture the value it has long ceded to firms like Apple and Nvidia.</s> <s>Whether it can climb that ladder is harder than building the factories that feed it, and it defines the next phase of the economic contest.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India rolled out its first hydrogen fuel-cell train on the Jind–Sonipat line, with water vapour as its only exhaust.</s> <s>Prime Minister Narendra Modi flagged it off, joining a small group of nations betting on zero-emission traction across unelectrified track.</s> <s>The real question is where the hydrogen comes from... green electrolysis truly cuts emissions, while fossil-based reforming just moves them somewhere else.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Tokyo imaged the immune-cell receptor <sub alias="G P R eighty-four">GPR84</sub> in both its active and inactive states.</s> <s>The structures show how a drug can trigger one signalling pathway while sparing another, a trick known as biased agonism.</s> <s>That gives drug designers a template for anti-inflammatory therapies that keep the benefit and drop the side effects.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain slashed its pledge to protect the Congo Basin from ninety million pounds to just eighteen point eight million.</s> <s>The programme was meant to fund half of London's climate promise, but the money was diverted to defence spending instead.</s> <s>Congo Basin nations, among the world's poorest, now shoulder the cost of guarding the planet's second-largest rainforest that a distant treasury abandoned.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Australia says it will choose its own path to manage artificial intelligence, rejecting both the European Union's binding law and Washington's light touch.</s> <s>Prime Minister Anthony Albanese framed it as a middle way, a test case for every country outside the American, Chinese, and European triangle.</s> <s>What matters is whether local rules will bind foreign models or merely ask them politely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Papua New Guinea's twenty twenty-seven election will become an early stress test of synthetic media in a low-connectivity democracy.</s> <s>In a country of thin bandwidth and low trust, a single viral deepfake can carry outsized weight, so a homegrown verification tool is now on offer.</s> <s>Whether it's ready in time will show whether the Pacific is the frontline of this fight, not an afterthought.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan is joining a Chinese-led artificial intelligence body, the World AI Cooperation Organisation, launched by Beijing last year.</s> <s>Deputy Prime Minister Ishaq Dar signs as a founding member, positioning the group as an alternative to Western-led standards for the Global South.</s> <s>The move deepens Islamabad's tilt toward Beijing as the world's digital rulebooks split into rival camps.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>